v0.1.1  23 October 2026
*   continuation of the original gjr80/weewx-xcumulative, which no longer exists
*   fix: install.py imported distutils.version.StrictVersion, which was removed
    in Python 3.12, so the extension could not be installed
*   dropped Python 2 support
*   the exception for an unparsable reset option now names the option
*   added tests and a justfile
*   removed readme.txt, README.md replaces it

